msgid "Update one or more Jetpack Stats settings. All fields are optional; only fields present in the call are written, and unrelated keys are preserved. Idempotent — setting a value to its current state returns changed=false. Shape: { changed, settings: { admin_bar, roles, count_roles, do_not_track } }. Role slugs added to `roles` or `count_roles` must be registered roles on the site; unknown slugs return jetpack_stats_invalid_role. A slug that is already saved is kept even when its role no longer exists. Narrowing `roles` can revoke Stats access for whole groups of users — confirm with the user before removing roles."
msgstr "Update one or more Jetpack Stats settings. All fields are optional; only fields present in the call are written, and unrelated keys are preserved. Idempotent — setting a value to its current state returns changed=false. Shape: { changed, settings: { admin_bar, roles, count_roles, do_not_track } }. Role slugs added to `roles` or `count_roles` must be registered roles on the site; unknown slugs return jetpack_stats_invalid_role. A slug that is already saved is kept even when its role no longer exists. Narrowing `roles` can revoke Stats access for whole groups of users — confirm with the user before removing roles."

