msgstr "Read the current Jetpack Stats settings: who sees the Stats admin bar + menu, whose visits are counted, and DNT behavior. Shape: { admin_bar, roles, count_roles, do_not_track }. `roles` is an array of role slugs that can view Stats; `count_roles` is an array of role slugs whose visits are counted. Call jetpack-stats/update-settings to change any of these."

