msgid "Return the top items for a chosen content type — posts, referrers, search terms, outbound clicks, tags/categories, authors, countries, downloads, or video plays — in one filtered call. Replaces nine atomic WPCOM endpoints with a single ability. Uniform shape: { type, period, date, num, max, items: [ { rank, label, value, href? } ] } — agents MUST NOT see a different shape per type. `label` is human-readable (post title, referrer host, search term, country name, etc.). `value` is the view/hit count for that item. `href` is present only when the item has a canonical URL. Precondition: site must be connected to WordPress.com."
msgstr "Return the top items for a chosen content type — posts, referrers, search terms, outbound clicks, tags/categories, authors, countries, downloads, or video plays — in one filtered call. Replaces nine atomic WPCOM endpoints with a single ability. Uniform shape: { type, period, date, num, max, items: [ { rank, label, value, href? } ] } — agents MUST NOT see a different shape per type. `label` is human-readable (post title, referrer host, search term, country name, etc.). `value` is the view/hit count for that item. `href` is present only when the item has a canonical URL. Precondition: site must be connected to WordPress.com."

